        "created_at": "2020-02-06T02:57:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've spent a bunch of time digging for it with no luck, so I'm hoping someone here can help me out.</p>\n<p>Does anyone remember the episode of The Letters Page that Christopher and Adam went into details about their plans for a new, updated edition of Sentinels of the Multiverse that would have newer versions of the art and story-based challenges for villains? The went into detail on some of the ideas they had around the new challenges, and we \"playtested\" Baron Blade's (from memory). I wanted to see how close we got to what they discussed. :-)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Any assistance is greatly appreciated!&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:29.690Z",
