        "created_at": "2020-02-06T20:55:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I did a search for \"Definitive\" in the wiki and came up with a few significant mentions:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Episode 92 (Perestroika)</li>\n\t<li>Episode 114 (Scenarios)</li>\n\t<li>Editor's Note #32</li>\n</ul>\n<p>I was actually looking for the first mention and couldn't find it.&nbsp; They probably weren't calling it the \"Definitive Edition\" formally back then.</p>",
